les even in the dimmest light."},{"id":"marker5","name":"Velggaz — iron mining town","legend":"Velggaz is a mining town of 1420 people just nearby the iron mine."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Odrugh — copper mining town","legend":"Odrugh is a mining town of 2924 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker7","name":"Igri — gold mining town","legend":"Igri is a mining town of 2213 people just nearby the gold mine."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Bral — silver mining town","legend":"Bral is a mining town of 3920 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker9","name":"Mocculd — silver mining town","legend":"Mocculd is a mining town of 4654 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker10","name":"Vrur — gold mining town","legend":"Vrur is a mining town of 255 people just nearby the gold mine."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Gerkrun — salt mining town","legend":"Gerkrun is a mining town of 2291 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker12","name":"Qiccad — copper mining town","legend":"Qiccad is a mining town of 656 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Castelnuo — copper mining town","legend":"Castelnuo is a mining town of 317 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Ghadog — silver mining town","legend":"Ghadog is a mining town of 743 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker15","name":"The Lucky Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious dressed cheese with green spirits is served here."},{"id":"marker16","name":"The Amber Hawk","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped garlic with yellow nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker17","name":"The Dark Bear","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious flame-broiled pasta with bright cider is served here."},{"id":"marker18","name":"The White Shark","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious pickled rat tails with bitter vodka is served here."},{"id":"marker19","name":"The Dark Hawk","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pickled hart with ice cider is served here."},{"id":"marker20","name":"The Giant Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious flame-broiled rice with amber juice is served here."},{"id":"marker21","name":"The Honest Jaguar","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious roasted catfish with smoky kumis is served here."},{"id":"marker22","name":"The Dark Falcon","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious pan-fried mango with amber beer is served here."},{"id":"marker23","name":"The Brown Ibis","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious baked ibis with hot mead is served here."},{"id":"marker24","name":"The Pink Crane","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious syrupped pheasant with misty cider is served here."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Brashaman Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Granthan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Kingdonter Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Har Invasion. \r\nDate: September 22, 1718 Khulanlig Era."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Burham Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Clitford Conquest. \r\nDate: January 21, 1525 Khulanlig Era."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Waltonwich Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Bertonby Intervention. \r\nDate: December 3, 1714 Khulanlig Era."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Tarlingin Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Benildock War. \r\nDate: February 4, 1716 Khulanlig Era."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Dodbleton Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Botford Conflict. \r\nDate: May 18, 1714 Khulanlig Era."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Midmouth Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Botford Conflict. \r\nDate: October 11, 1715 Khulanlig Era."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Haton Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Har Invasion. \r\nDate: October 7, 1717 Khulanlig Era."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982064782\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982064782\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker35","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982065228\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982065228\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker36","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982063383\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982063383\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker37","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982067195\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982067195\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker38","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982062817\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982062817\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker39","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=28639820620