ungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982068441\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker51","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982065629\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982065629\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker52","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982063173\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982063173\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker53","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982067480\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982067480\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker54","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982063265\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982063265\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker55","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982062015\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982062015\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker56","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982064931\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2863982064931\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker57","name":"Newbover Monster","legend":"Tales say a relic monster of 8 ft long inhabits Newbover Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Thornden Monster","legend":"Legends say a relic monster of 13 ft long inhabits Thornden Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Quatbuse Banshee","legend":"Elders speak of a great Banshee who inhabits Quatbuse hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Yeolesmouth Bearded Devil","legend":"Tipplers speak of a terrifying Bearded Devil who inhabits Yeolesmouth hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Holseacuse Vampire","legend":"Whispers speak of a magical Vampire who inhabits Holseacuse hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Albridge Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Buclifan Way."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Ugaustheiz'la Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Trow Forefathers."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Burton Sharks","legend":"A gang of desert bandits."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Westcking Boars","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Searestowen Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">የተሐደአጸዘሐፀሠኀጰ ኀፀፀሰመዐመዐሀደዘረኀ ኀሠበበመ ሰሠአዐሰሠጠበተቀተወኀዐሰፐነነ ለ ገወሀሐፀጠ ሐነኀ  ገፀዘፐሐየዐቀሐበገወቀሐ አለረአ ዘቀቀየወፀ</div>"},{"id":"marker68","name":"Rombegover Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘጸ ሐጰወፈ ፀረበ ነ ሐሠተነከሠሐከረሰለሠ ዐጸየዐደተወሀረወበኀቀገጸ ሠኀየ ሰደ ቀሠወወዐሀሰነሀ ፈፈከተሠኀአጸ ኀሀሐኀወጰወገለኀ ፀፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker69","name":"Skipton Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ቀየ  ጠሀየሰኀፀፈለበበሰጰፐጰጸጸነጰተሰየገኀየተዐዘወአከዘዐሐ ነተ አመተፐጰለኀፀበከገ ወ ቀኀፀረዘተገሠጰፈፐለነሐበ</div>"},{"id":"marker70","name":"Mamerstowey Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">  ጸኀዐደ  ከ ከሐፀየተሀቀኀሀገፐ ጸመረየዘከሰጠፀፀወዐ  ኀኀሀሀዘዘሰዐጰየተ ረረደወፈኀ  ጠሀየለወረጰሠበየሐመደጰ ቀረፀደቀ ጰጸጠሀዘደ</div>"},{"id":"marker71","name":"Kendon Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰ ገሀጠነአገተነሀኀወቀደሀበወሠጠሰሰገየሠደነሀ ረሠነወኀየወሰተተበሀፈሠፐ አፈተሀሰየመሀከደነተጰ ረሐረመ ደደቀጸነ ጰ ኀቀረፀፈከፈሠኀ ወሠ ኀሐሀ  አአጰነ አየደ</div>"},{"id":"marker72","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Alington Collection","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Hloizex Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Hloizex, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Normouth River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Mantises migration","legend":"A huge group of mantises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Hyenas migration","legend":"A huge group of hyenas are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Mules migration","legend":"A huge group of mules are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Mooses migration","legend":"A huge group of mooses are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Cranes migration","legend":"A huge group of cranes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Agrocro Chasm","legend":"The Agrocro Chasm. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Perswestham Ravine","legend":"The Perswestham Ravine. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Carwick Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine.